  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "sharing_and_caring_mapping",
  "label": "The phrase 'sharing and caring' is mapped onto the visual interaction between the man and the goat.",
  "description": "The text 'sharing and caring' is overlaid on the image of a man sharing a snack with a goat. This creates an analogical mapping where the human-animal interaction is interpreted as an example of 'sharing and caring', despite the absurdity of applying this human-centric social concept to an animal. The mapping is ironic, as the visual material (man and goat sharing food) is used to represent the textual concept (sharing and caring), thereby creating a humorous or satirical contrast.",
